              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Ensure Plus is built to add weight: 350 calories and 19 g of sugar in 8 fl oz of the dark chocolate flavor, per Abbott's label. Drinking one a day on top of normal meals adds about 4,900 calories every two weeks if nothing else changes. For a diet, Premier or Max Protein does the job at under half the calories.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
