              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Premier and Ensure Max Protein have 150 to 160 calories and almost no carbohydrate or fat. Replacing lunch with one cuts several hundred calories at once, which usually ends in an afternoon of snacking. Add food alongside the shake, or use a true meal replacement if you need one bottle to stand in for a meal.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
