                Ensure Original looks cheapest at about $1.48 a bottle, but at 9 g of protein it costs about $4.12 per 25 g, more than twice Premier's $1.86. Divide the price by total protein in the pack, or by total calories if weight gain is the goal, before you decide which pack is the better deal.
              </p>
