              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A 30 g shake can be a big share of a protein-restricted renal diet, and Ensure Plus carries 47 g of carbohydrate per bottle. Older adults are the main buyers of both brands and the group most likely to have kidney disease or diabetes. Ask a doctor or dietitian which product fits before making either a daily habit.
              </p>
